=2 Walkthrough
* Prepare to battle. {p:Trust Magic} can not be used in this fight.
** You will keep your buffs and pets.
* Examine the **???** at (G-6) in {z:Qufim Island} to begin a battle.
* Several waves of {m:Seed Mandragoras|Seed Mandragora} will spawn and swarm the characters. Though 5 or 6 will come at a time, they are very weak and can be easily defeated with one melee strike or AoE magic.
* After killing several waves of Seed Mandragora (30 total, six waves of 5) you will receive a message that the mission has ended, and an {@k} {k:Amber Key}.
* Examine the **???** again for a cutscene.

=2 "A Crystalline Prophecy" Key
* Re-obtain a {@k} {k:Seedspall Roseum}, {@k}{k:Seedspall Caerulum}, and {@k}{k:Seedspall Viridis} from popping the {m:Goblin} NMs from the previous mission.
** Requires the Goblin Food Key Items: {@k} {k:Bowl of bland Goblin salad}, {@k} {k:Jug of greasy Goblin juice}, and {@k} {k:Chunk of smoked Goblin grub}.
*** Goblin Food Key Items are not lost when used to spawn the NMs.
** Alternatively, the 3 Seedspall Key Items can be purchased from {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} for 500g and 5 {i:Beastmen's Seals|Beastmen's Seal|1126} after all {p:Crystalline Missions|Category:Crystalline Missions} are completed.
* Travel to {z:Qufim Island} and examine the **???** (G-6) to begin the battle with the {m:Seed Mandragoras|Seed Mandragora}.
* When you've defeated all six waves of {m:Seed Mandragoras|Seed Mandragora} you will receive an {@k} {k:Amber Key},
** The key can be received once per day.
* Use the {@k} {k:Amber Key} (Level 50) to open the red treasure coffer at {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8).
** Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.

